Human Research Act (HRA)
SR 810.30 — Federal Act of 30 September 2011 on Research involving Human Beings (Human Research Act, HRA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2013/617]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
English consolidation of 1 September 2023, which is also the date of the current binding text.

:INFO
Preamble
The Federal Assembly of the Swiss Confederation,
on the basis of Article 118b paragraph 1 of the Federal Constitution,and having considered the Dispatch of the Federal Council dated 21 October 2009,
decrees:
|

